  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLogic: (First number + Third number) ÷ 3 = Second number.\n\nFor, (25, 30, 65)\n\n⇒ (25 + 65) ÷ 3 = 30\n\n⇒ 90 ÷ 3 = 30\n\n⇒ 30 = 30\n\nFor, (50, 50, 100)\n\n⇒ (50 + 100) ÷ 3 = 50\n\n⇒ 150 ÷ 3 = 50\n\n⇒ 50 = 50\n\nNow, checking the options:\n\nOption 1) (44, 157, 14)\n\n⇒ (44 + 14) ÷ 3 = 157\n\n⇒ 58 ÷ 3 = 157\n\n⇒ 19.34 ≠ 157\n\nOption 2) (25, 132, 18)\n\n⇒ (25 + 18) ÷ 3 = 132\n\n⇒ 43 ÷ 3 = 132\n\n⇒ 14.34 ≠ 132\n\nOption 3) (45, 40, 75)\n\n⇒ (45 + 75) ÷ 3 = 40\n\n⇒ 120 ÷ 3 = 40 \n\n⇒ 40 = 40\n\nOption 4) (35, 178, 15)\n\n⇒ (35 + 15) ÷ 3 = 178\n\n⇒ 50 ÷ 3 = 178\n\n⇒ 16.67 ≠ 178\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
